          "id": "5e005b33-9445-41e3-a994-c6957baf60ef",
          "name": "Create a 24-hour authorization session token for the workspace-management endpoints. The returned token grants `workspaces` write access for the authenticated user and is required as a Bearer credential on the `/v2/workspaces` routes. Returns 404 if no user matches the email and 401 if the password is invalid or the user is not a workspaces admin.",
